   "raw": "MINI UPS\nMiniUPS_26650\nInput Power\nDC 12V 3A (+/- 5%) On a Barrel jack connector\nOutput Power\nDC 12V 2.5A (+/- 5%), 2 outputs on a barrel jack connector\nUSB Power\nDC 5V 0.5A +/- 5% on a USB Type A Connector\nBattery Type\nCylindrical Lithium-Ion Rechargeable Cell\nBattery mAH\n5000mAH (3.7 V nominal) x2 Nos\nBattery Type/Size\n26650\nBattery Backup\n38Whr\nLED's\nOutput Power Indication & Charging Status / Battery Fault\nFeatures\n•\nBattery overcharge and over discharge protection\n•\nAuto turn-on feature which helps in sensing the input\npower from power adapter and automatically TURNS ON\nthe output power.\n•\nTouch Button to Turn off.\n•\nBattery Thermal protection.\n•\nOutput short circuit protection.\n•\nUser Replaceable Batteries.\nApplication\nBattery Backup for Home Router, IP camera, Set Top Box, Kiosks etc\nwww.invendis.com"
